# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your real key in.
# .env.local is gitignored, so the key never reaches GitHub.
#
# Get a key from https://console.anthropic.com → Settings → API keys
#
# This is read on the SERVER only (src/lib/claude.ts). It is never sent to the
# browser. Anything named NEXT_PUBLIC_* would be — which is exactly why this
# one is not.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
